{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","id":"b9ff3a73-8918-4547-9c9b-baa6955270d9","timestamp":"2026-10-24T04:19:32.359Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"761156c7f8e5f9beaaf03c55d45c00e6108ed5cc90a785040747ceaf99aae387","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"5f290b27-d4c4-4889-9701-0613516b13d6","keep":686,"tail":["355fa2a7aa8a1f09e3909532781d40ac9e10a0a2d1aaa89316c2ccaae41776f6","efd7b3293ede2037cdf230b3b2e2148a7ce9a8651f015893f71dee6c54da137b","7bb472f1021d6b350781f3ee31055912acaedb9f7d7da6837d20f476dcade582"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",688,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"157e73adf1898876b6cace8ef592d213b02b73177342ad816cdffa4f9d2adfad"}
{"parentUuid":"af69f2cc-07d1-4781-aa16-733a0f84126b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLRH6qQ8Kz51HanWTxgw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next, one decision for you, and it is time-sensitive.\n\n**What happened:** #340 merged before #342. The 0.14.1 release is running now. It has only reached \"Verify release candidate\", so nothing is published yet. Two consequences:\n- The 0.14.1 changelog has two entries about tag hints (written and read) that `main` no longer supports.\n- The released 0.14.1 binary would write hints into its tags, because the version commit predates the revert.\n\n**Your options:**\n1. **Cancel the run** (`gh run cancel`) while it is still verifying. Nothing is published and the 0.14.1 tag doesn't exist. I'd then fix the changelog, delete the two stale entries and rerun release, which is safe to repeat because reruns adopt landed effects. It costs about one more PR.\n2. **Let 0.14.1 ship as is.** It is harmless: the hint data is about 130 bytes per tag and readers fall back without it. The look-patience fix and the cleanup then go out in 0.14.2, whose changelog will not mention hints being removed. The record for 0.14.1 stays slightly misleading.\n\nI lean toward option 1, since it is still free to stop. I won't cancel it myself; say go and I will.\n\nAfter that, the next work is still on your list: the OIDC decision, the private-root exclusion shape, ADR 12 acceptance, and the spec-drift pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":439344,"output_tokens":458,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":640,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":439344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":640,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":640},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0a1ad013-f934-484f-8c64-c66b679f31d1","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgLRH6WoYzYqMKWoCm9Gi","requestRef":"b9ff3a73-8918-4547-9c9b-baa6955270d9","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a7d7128e-585c-46d5-9889-a5a96b410e84","timestamp":"2026-10-24T04:19:36.745Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"docs/cleanup-stale","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
