{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"8ac0ef2fb14fde01c6d2531dbca1fd34303bd08067fba145ca452d69c060aae7","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ky5LKkkBaGF7kSW9hWeqBB","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/workspace.json","old_string":"A changeset, `callisto add --package` or `callisto matrix --package` naming the bare name of promoted packages fails with E103 listing every qualified candidate and showing the qualified form to write; naming a package that does not exist under that name in that ecosystem fails with E102.","new_str":"A changeset entry naming the bare name of promoted packages fails `version` with E103 listing every qualified candidate and showing the qualified form to write, and `status` reports it as an error diagnostic. `callisto add --package` and `callisto matrix --package` reject any bare name with E317 and a qualified name no package has with E102. A changeset entry naming a package that does not exist is a warning in `version`, and the changeset is not consumed."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NwjKUPyoiSkjPz7VnEquLv","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/workspace.json","old_string":"A package that inherits when no such workspace exists, whose `package.workspace` names no workspace or leaves the root, or whose ancestors cannot be read or parsed, fails with E313 naming the package.","new_str":"A package that inherits when no Cargo.toml at or above it has a `workspace` table fails with E313 naming its manifest. A `package.workspace` that names a directory without a `[workspace]` or leaves the workspace root fails with E310, and an ancestor Cargo.toml that cannot be parsed fails with E209, each naming the file."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EMTKKY1xYZz4vZjQdu2FBH","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/workspace.json","old_string":"the first matching set in declaration order wins, and a `cargo:`/`cargo/`, `npm:`/`npm/` or `pypi:`/`pypi/` prefix restricts it to packages with a manifest in that ecosystem.","new_str":"the first matching set in declaration order wins, its `match` must start with `cargo/`, `npm/` or `pypi/` (a bare pattern is E317, the colon form E316), and the glob is compared with the package's name in that ecosystem."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GMXJEzjasiYzfz5Qbdkxq9","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/workspace.json","old_string":"name matches applies,; a rule","new_str":"name matches applies; a rule"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015DnjwSiZ9aUMtavtKYEqV8","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/workspace.json","old_string":"`product-package` and `[[release.artifact]] package`. Changeset","new_str":"`product-package` and `[[release.artifact]] package`, and likewise `add --package` and `matrix --package`. Changeset"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
